# tasks_map_tracker_multiblock: The range tracker across several run blocks (blocks only, for the reason tasks_map_tracker gives): 481 single-page runs fill two blocks and start a third; then maps that span blocks or merge many runs inside one, unmaps inside a block, across two, of a whole block and past the end, lazy probes over several blocks (the map_memory calls each probe makes are what the tracker thought unmapped). The last probe, over [0, 1010) after a map of [0, 1000) across the fragmented blocks, kills the host: adding a lazily mapped run reaches one of the tracker's aborts.
